From 4fd044c7cd1dffe9b1c3244822bb6bdc4dc1882f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tanjilbhuiyan <a50@localhost>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 18:38:14 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] arm64: dts: exynos: add Samsung Galaxy A50 (exynos9610)
 first-light DT

SoC subset (CPUs, PSCI, GICv2, arch timer, oscillator) plus board DT with
memory, bootloader-reserved regions, ramoops window and a simple-framebuffer
at 0xca000000. Sources are cited per node. Framebuffer pixel format and the
ramoops persistence are unverified until M2.4/M1.5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I8c4081e027dbab689b5c9fa71454bc7bc6b4ef9e
---
